Maintainer: tunaichao <tunaichao@uniontech.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.5.1

Package: lto-disabled-list
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: list of packages not to build with LTO
 A list of source packages not to build with link time
 optimization (LTO). Consulted by the dpkg vendor build
 features at build time; dpkg-dev depends on this package.
 .
 Initial entries: the 116 source packages that ended the UOS
 archive LTO rebuild on x86_64 (September 2026) APPLY_FAILED or
 UPLOAD_GIVEUP, excluded on all architectures so that the arm64 /
 sw64 / loong64 rebuilds do not trip over them. Ubuntu
 lto-disabled-list v81 is the reference baseline for future
 entries, minus the qt6-* entries, as deepin already builds the
 Qt6 stack with LTO.
